<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS FROM THE CZECH INDOOR OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS FROM THE CZECH INDOOR OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>OSTRAVA, Czech Republic 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final</p>
<p>results from the $475,000 Czech Indoor Open on Friday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>7-Tim Henman (Britain) beat 2-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>David Prinosil (Germany) beat 5-Todd Martin (U.S.) 7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Martin Damm (Czech Republic) beat 6-Michael Stich (Germany) 5-7 6-4 6-4  </p>
<p>Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) 6-1 6-0</p>
</text>
